@startuml OOPomanContext
left to right direction

actor Student
actor "Course owner\n(Roman)" as Owner
rectangle "OOPoman course shell\n(opened locally in Chrome)" as Site {
  component "Course route\n(three modules)" as CourseUI
  component "Week availability\n(Week 1 open; 2–3 locked)" as Availability
  component "Empty theory and\npractice pages" as EmptyPages
  component "Progress page\nand confirmed reset" as ProgressUI
}
database "Chrome profile\nlocalStorage: oopoman.progress.v1" as Progress
folder "OOP-course/\n(read-only source PDFs)" as Materials

Student --> CourseUI : follows the route
CourseUI --> Availability : shows open and locked weeks
CourseUI --> EmptyPages : presents unfilled page shells
Student --> ProgressUI : reads or resets progress
ProgressUI --> Progress : reads; removes only OOPoman key
CourseUI --> Progress : records a viewed lab as started
Owner --> Availability : authorizes opening Weeks 2 and 3

note bottom of Site
  Local file opened directly in Chrome.
  No network service, login, activities,
  grading, points, or code execution.
end note

note bottom of Materials
  Numbered names identify module grouping.
  PDF content is not copied or modified.
end note
@enduml
